<title>DENMARK: Deutsche Bank ups 4 pct 2005 bond to 500 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank ups 4 pct 2005 bond to 500 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank Finance N.V. has increased an existing four percent bond due 2005 by 200 million Danish crowns to 500 million, Denmark's Nykredit Bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Nykredit said that it and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell were buying the extra paper for resale.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
</text>
